  "description": "Phase 1 (2010 - 2017) Statewide LiDAR-derived Digital Elevation Model.\n\nThis dataset provides access to a LiDAR-derived 5 Foot Digital Elevation Model (DEM) for the entire Commonwealth of Kentucky. LiDAR was collected at Quality Level (QL) 3 and QL2 from 2010 – 2017 for Kentucky Aerial Photography and Elevevation (KYAPED) project areas while no snow was on the ground and rivers were at or below normal levels.",
